.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Isolation session bookkeeping
.brain-sessions/
.brain-worktrees/

# Disposable retrieval index (docs/designs/retrieval-ladder.md). Git + Markdown
# stay source of truth; deleting these files is always valid recovery.
# Do not ignore the whole `.pkc/` directory — repo-level `.pkc/config.yml` lives there.
**/.pkc/index.sqlite
**/.pkc/index.sqlite-journal
**/.pkc/index.sqlite-wal
**/.pkc/index.sqlite-shm
